        "type": "plain_text",
        "text": "1. Schedule a documented performance conversation this week with specific examples.\n2. Issue a written memo confirming expectations, the gap, and what success looks like. Get a signature.\n3. Set a structured check-in date 2–4 weeks out and put it on the calendar."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "text": {
        "type": "plain_text",
        "text": "If you are unsure whether the performance issue is connected to a medical condition, leave, or a recent complaint — stop and contact HR before doing anything else."
